  message: "Recurrence (2026-06-21): the 'slice command failed / Input file not found: None' fallback reproduced during 'pytest' (full smart-test) manifest generation this session — slice_exit_code=1 after ~347s, tripping the full-suite manifest fallback. So clearing the hypergumbo cache (your 2026-06-18 note) did NOT resolve it; the forward-slice failure persists. Other 'pytest' runs in the same session DID get a clean targeted slice, so it remains intermittent. Fallback is graceful (full-suite manifest, suite green), so it didn't block work — recording as fresh evidence the root cause (cli.py _get_or_run_analysis slice --files path) is still live post-cache-clear."  # b3a0
